# NOTE: firebase_options.dart, google-services.json, and GoogleService-Info.plist
# are intentionally NOT gitignored here. Firebase client config values are not
# secret (Google's own docs confirm this) — real protection comes from your
# Firestore Security Rules, not from hiding these files. Since the reviewer
# needs to clone and run this repo, commit your real generated config files.
# If you'd rather not, gitignore them here and mention that in your README
# so the reviewer knows to add their own.

